#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1238 expect=noViolation domain=PC
#note "No PCRFTDTC column at all; the negated-bare-empty lead (not empty(--RFTDTC)) over the absent column broadcast-folds FALSE -> the rule executes and reports nothing (silent noViolation, not a skip). THE FLIP FIXTURE for SD1238-F1: becomes expect=skipped if the lane later adds Requirements.Variables.All [--RFTDTC]."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset PC class=FINDINGS
col STUDYID   type=Char
col DOMAIN    type=Char
col USUBJID   type=Char
col PCSEQ     type=Num
col PCTESTCD  type=Char
col PCTPTREF  type=Char
---
S1 | PC | 001 | 1 | DRUGA | DOSE
